{"id":"n66966-2-6","stage":4,"title":"얽히다 · 相关","scene":"社会与交往","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n66966-2-6-1","ko":"너희 마을 앞에 있는 나무는 정말 오래돼 보이더라.","zh":"你们村子前面的那棵树看起来真的非常古老呢。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"너희","meaning":"你们","explanation":"너희：你们。","readings":[{"term":"너희","audio":"/audio/ab3c37ad0aa2e0ba11c1.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"61180","senseId":"2","lemma":"너희","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"너희","audio":"/audio/ab3c37ad0aa2e0ba11c1.mp3"}},{"text":"마을","meaning":"村子，村庄","explanation":"마을：村子，村庄。","readings":[{"term":"마을","audio":"/audio/16a6e53889b32d5b72f4.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"61099","senseId":"1","lemma":"마을","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"마을","audio":"/audio/16a6e53889b32d5b72f4.mp3"}},{"text":"앞에","meaning":"前，前面","explanation":"앞：前，前面；에：格助词，表示时间、位置、去向、对象等；需结合整句理解。","readings":[{"term":"앞","audio":"/audio/ec1a6b96ce688b70368d.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"88648","senseId":"1","lemma":"앞","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"앞에","audio":"/audio/6ee410c0325daaa6155d.mp3"}},{"text":"있는","meaning":"有","explanation":"있다：有；-는：将前面的动作或状态转为修饰名词的形式。","readings":[{"term":"있다","audio":"/audio/96fe52db2531c9e73e53.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"68797","senseId":"1","lemma":"있다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"있는","audio":"/audio/9714c770db7ebcb9f4f1.mp3"}},{"text":"나무는","meaning":"树，树木","explanation":"나무：树，树木；는：话题或对比助词。","readings":[{"term":"나무","audio":"/audio/b294b251f77dfbc5ede4.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"32750","senseId":"1","lemma":"나무","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"나무는","audio":"/audio/c665e4df595a0ea9cc60.mp3"}},{"text":"정말","meaning":"真的","explanation":"정말：真的。","readings":[{"term":"정말","audio":"/audio/6f24e21fc8cce6bd9e56.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"61174","senseId":"1","lemma":"정말","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"정말","audio":"/audio/6f24e21fc8cce6bd9e56.mp3"}},{"text":"오래돼","meaning":"久，老","explanation":"오래되다：久，老；어：连接后续动作或辅助表达；常与前面的词干缩合。","readings":[{"term":"오래되다","audio":"/audio/7d268ef946cccd3a8e4b.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"89515","senseId":"1","lemma":"오래되다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"오래돼","audio":"/audio/e15b9440dc99c7fdf6c9.mp3"}},{"text":"보이더라.","meaning":"看起来，看上去","explanation":"보이다：看起来，看上去；더라：回顾并告诉对方亲身观察到的情况，非敬语。","readings":[{"term":"보이다","audio":"/audio/da6f27438e6f345c1e87.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62091","senseId":"4","lemma":"보이다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"보이더라","audio":"/audio/90577e8924c70d1f2c54.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"ab3c37ad0aa2e0ba","term":"너희","zh":"你们","audio":"/audio/ab3c37ad0aa2e0ba11c1.mp3","entryId":"61180","definition":"指代包括听者在内的多数人，用于朋友或晚辈。","pronunciation":["너히"]},{"id":"16a6e53889b32d5b","term":"마을","zh":"村子，村庄","audio":"/audio/16a6e53889b32d5b72f4.mp3","entryId":"61099","definition":"多户人家聚集生活的地方。","pronunciation":["마을"]},{"id":"ec1a6b96ce688b70","term":"앞","zh":"前，前面","audio":"/audio/ec1a6b96ce688b70368d.mp3","entryId":"88648","definition":"所向的一面或地方。","pronunciation":["압"]},{"id":"96fe52db2531c9e7","term":"있다","zh":"有","audio":"/audio/96fe52db2531c9e73e53.mp3","entryId":"68797","definition":"人或动物、物体等存在的状态。","pronunciation":["읻따"]},{"id":"b294b251f77dfbc5","term":"나무","zh":"树，树木","audio":"/audio/b294b251f77dfbc5ede4.mp3","entryId":"32750","definition":"拥有坚硬的茎杆，上面长有枝叶的多年生植物。","pronunciation":["나무"]},{"id":"6f24e21fc8cce6bd","term":"정말","zh":"真的","audio":"/audio/6f24e21fc8cce6bd9e56.mp3","entryId":"61174","definition":"没有虚假而真正地。","pronunciation":["정ː말"]},{"id":"7d268ef946cccd3a","term":"오래되다","zh":"久，老","audio":"/audio/7d268ef946cccd3a8e4b.mp3","entryId":"89515","definition":"开始或发生后，经过的时间长。","pronunciation":["오래되다","오래뒈다"]},{"id":"da6f27438e6f345c","term":"보이다","zh":"看起来，看上去","audio":"/audio/da6f27438e6f345c1e87.mp3","entryId":